<h1>mdhtml <em>notes</em></h1>
<p>A paragraph with <strong>strong</strong>, <em>em</em>, <code>a &lt; b</code> and a
<a href="https://go.dev/doc?a=1&amp;b=2">link</a> on two lines.</p>
<p>Escaped: *not em*, [not a link], and a lone * star.</p>
<ul>
<li>first</li>
<li>second, <em>with</em> <code>code</code>
and a lazy line</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>a new list, another marker</li>
</ul>
<ol start="3">
<li>three</li>
<li>four</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>a bullet ends the numbered list</li>
</ul>
<pre><code class="language-go">func main() {
	if x &lt; 1 {
		return
	}
}
</code></pre>
<hr />
<h2><a href="">bad</a> link</h2>
<h6>six</h6>
<p>####### seven is text</p>
<h2>Setext heading</h2>
<blockquote>
<p>A quote with a list:</p>
<ul>
<li>one
<ul>
<li>nested <em>deeper</em></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p>and a <a href="https://go.dev" title="The Go site">reference</a> link,
lazily continued.</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code>indented code
  keeps its spaces
</code></pre>
